L 206</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=SOIL%20206H\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:SOIL 206H\"  class=\"notoffered\">SOIL 206H</a> and <a href=\"/search/?p=FOR%20206\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:FOR 206\"  class=\"notoffered\">FOR 206</a>.</p>", "corequisites": "", "department_approval_required": "", "recommendations": "", "fees": "", "attribute_description": "<ul><li>Bacc Core, Perspectives \u2013 Physical Science Attached Lecture (CPPL)</li><li>Core Education - Scientific Inquiry &amp; Analysis Attached Lecture (CFSX)</li></ul>", "books_html": "", "clssnotes": "<p>Avoid \u2018prerequisite\u2019 error: ADD SOIL 205 and 206 at the same\ntime.\n<p><a href=\"http://oregonstate.edu/registrar/rtfiles/q.html?\n:&202701&SOIL&205&001&12220\" target=\"blank\">Textbooks</a></p>", "meeting_html": "<div class=\"meet\">MWF 11am-11:50am<span class=\"meet-room-202701\"> in <a href=\"https://map.oregonstate.edu/?id=2243#!m/1027695?share\" target=\"_blank\">PFSC 117 - Peavy Forest Science Center 117 (GP)</a></span><span class=\"meet-dates\"> (9/23 to 12/4)</span></div>", "exams_html": "", "instructordetail_html": "<div class=\"instructor-detail\">James Cassidy</div>", "all_sections": "<div class=\"course-sections\" role=\"grid\" aria-readonly=\"true\"><div role=\"row\"><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">CRN</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Section #</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Campus</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Meets</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Type</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Max Enrl</div><div role=\"columnheader\" scope=\"col\">Actual Enrl</div></div><a role=\"row\" href=\"#\" class=\"course-section\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:SOIL 205\" data-srcdb=\"202701\" data-key=\"crn:12220\"><div role=\"rowheader\" class=\"course-section-crn\"><span class=\"header-text\">CRN: </span> 12220</div><div role=\"gridcell\" class=\"course-section-sectio